'>{}</span>", "ja497:18.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja497:19.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja497:19.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja497:19.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja497:19.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja497:20.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja497:20.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja497:20.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja497:20.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja497:21.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja497:21.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja497:21.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja497:21.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja497:22.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja497:22.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja497:22.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja497:22.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja497:23.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja497:23.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja497:23.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja497:23.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja497:24.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja497:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja497:0.2": "Vīsatinipāta ", "ja497:0.3": "Mātaṅgavagga ", "ja497:0.4": "1. Mātaṅgajātaka ", "ja497:1.1": "“Kuto nu āgacchasi dummavāsī, ", "ja497:1.2": "Otallako paṁsupisācakova; ", "ja497:1.3": "Saṅkāracoḷaṁ paṭimuñca kaṇṭhe, ", "ja497:1.4": "Ko re tuvaṁ hosi adakkhiṇeyyo”. ", "ja497:2.1": "“Annaṁ tavedaṁ pakataṁ yasassi, ", "ja497:2.2": "Taṁ khajjare bhuñjare piyyare ca; ", "ja497:2.3": "Jānāsi maṁ tvaṁ paradattūpajīviṁ, ", "ja497:2.4": "Uttiṭṭhapiṇḍaṁ labhataṁ sapāko”. ", "ja497:3.1": "“Annaṁ mamedaṁ pakataṁ brāhmaṇānaṁ, ", "ja497:3.2": "Attatthāya saddahato mamedaṁ; ", "ja497:3.3": "Apehi etto kimidhaṭṭhitosi, ", "ja497:3.4": "Na mādisā tuyhaṁ dadanti jamma”. ", "ja497:4.1": "“Thale ca ninne ca vapanti bījaṁ, ", "ja497:4.2": "Anūpakhette phalamāsamānā; ", "ja497:4.3": "Etāya saddhāya dadāhi dānaṁ, ", "ja497:4.4": "Appeva ārādhaye dakkhiṇeyye”. ", "ja497:5.1": "“Khettāni mayhaṁ viditāni loke, ", "ja497:5.2": "Yesāhaṁ bījāni patiṭṭhapemi; ", "ja497:5.3": "Ye brāhmaṇā jātimantūpapannā, ", "ja497:5.4": "Tānīdha khettāni supesalāni”. ", "ja497:6.1": "“Jātimado ca atimānitā ca, ", "ja497:6.2": "Lobho ca doso ca mado ca moho; ", "ja497:6.3": "Ete aguṇā yesu ca santi sabbe, ", "ja497:6.4": "Tānīdha khettāni apesalāni. ", "ja497:7.1": "Jātimado ca atimānitā ca, ", "ja497:7.2": "Lobho ca doso ca mado ca moho; ", "ja497:7.3": "Ete aguṇā yesu na santi sabbe, ", "ja497:7.4": "Tānīdha khettāni supesalāni”. ", "ja497:8.1": "“Kvettha gatā upajotiyo ca, ", "ja497:8.2": "Upajjhāyo ca atha vā gaṇḍakucchi; ", "ja497:8.3": "Imassa daṇḍañca vadhañca datvā, ", "ja497:8.4": "Gale gahetvā khalayātha jammaṁ”. ", "ja497:9.1": "“Giriṁ nakhena khaṇasi, ", "ja497:9.2": "ayo dantehi khādasi; ", "ja497:9.3": "Jātavedaṁ padahasi, ", "ja497:9.4": "yo isiṁ paribhāsasi”. ", "ja497:10.1": "“Idaṁ vatvāna mātaṅgo, ", "ja497:10.2": "isi saccaparakkamo; ", "ja497:10.3": "Antalikkhasmiṁ pakkāmi, ", "ja497:10.4": "brāhmaṇānaṁ udikkhataṁ”. ", "ja497:11.1": "“Āvellitaṁ piṭṭhito uttamaṅgaṁ, ", "ja497:11.2": "Bāhuṁ pasāreti akammaneyyaṁ; ", "ja497:11.3": "Setāni akkhīni yathā matassa, ", "ja497:11.4": "Ko me imaṁ puttamakāsi evaṁ”. ", "ja497:12.1": "“Idhāgamā samaṇo dummavāsī, ", "ja497:12.2": "Otallako paṁsupisācakova; ", "ja497:12.3": "Saṅkāracoḷaṁ paṭimuñca kaṇṭhe, ", "ja497:12.4": "So te imaṁ puttamakāsi evaṁ”. ", "ja497:13.1": "“Katamaṁ disaṁ agamā bhūripañño, ", "ja497:13.2": "Akkhātha me māṇavā etamatthaṁ; ", "ja497:13.3": "Gantvāna taṁ paṭikaremu accayaṁ, ", "ja497:13.4": "Appeva naṁ putta labhemu jīvitaṁ”. ", "ja497:14.1": "“Vehāyasaṁ agamā bhūripañño, ", "ja497:14.2": "Pathaddhuno pannaraseva cando; ", "ja497:14.3": "Api cāpi so purimadisaṁ agacchi, ", "ja497:14.4": "Saccappaṭiñño isi sādhurūpo”. ", "ja497:15.1": "“Āvellitaṁ piṭṭhito uttamaṅgaṁ, ", "ja497:15.2": "Bāhuṁ pasāreti akammaneyyaṁ; ", "ja497:15.3": "Setāni akkhīni yathā matassa, ", "ja497:15.4": "Ko me imaṁ puttamakāsi evaṁ”. ", "ja497:16.1": "“Yakkhā have santi mahānubhāvā, ", "ja497:16.2": "Anvāgatā isayo sādhurūpā; ", "ja497:16.3": "Te duṭṭhacittaṁ kupitaṁ viditvā, ", "ja497:16.4": "Yakkhā hi te puttamakaṁsu evaṁ”. ", "ja497:17.1": "“Yakkhā ca me puttamakaṁsu evaṁ, ", "ja497:17.2": "Tvaññeva me mā kuddho brahmacāri; ", "ja497:17.3": "Tumheva pāde saraṇaṁ gatāsmi, ", "ja497:17.4": "Anvāgatā puttasokena bhikkhu”. ", "ja497:18.1": "“Tadeva hi etarahi ca mayhaṁ, ", "ja497:18.2": "Manopadoso na mamatthi koci; ", "ja497:18.3": "Putto ca te vedamadena matto, ", "ja497:18.4": "Atthaṁ na jānāti adhicca vede”. ", "ja497:19.1": "“Addhā have bhikkhu muhuttakena, ", "ja497:19.2": "Sammuyhateva purisassa saññā; ", "ja497:19.3": "Ekāparādhaṁ khama bhūripañña, ", "ja497:19.4": "Na paṇḍitā kodhabalā bhavanti”. ", "ja497:20.1": "“Idañca mayhaṁ uttiṭṭhapiṇḍaṁ, ", "ja497:20.2": "Tava maṇḍabyo bhuñjatu appapañño; ", "ja497:20.3": "Yakkhā ca te naṁ na viheṭhayeyyuṁ, ", "ja497:20.4": "Putto ca te hessati so arogo”. ", "ja497:21.1": "“Maṇḍabya bālosi parittapañño, ", "ja497:21.2": "Yo puññakhettānamakovidosi; ", "ja497:21.3": "Mahakkasāvesu dadāsi dānaṁ, ", "ja497:21.4": "Kiliṭṭhakammesu asaññatesu. ", "ja497:22.1": "Jaṭā ca kesā ajinā nivatthā, ", "ja497:22.2": "Jarūdapānaṁva mukhaṁ parūḷhaṁ; ", "ja497:22.3": "Pajaṁ imaṁ passatha dummarūpaṁ, ", "ja497:22.4": "Na jaṭājinaṁ tāyati appapaññaṁ. ", "ja497:23.1": "Yesaṁ rāgo ca doso ca, ", "ja497:23.2": "avijjā ca virājitā; ", "ja497:23.3": "Khīṇāsavā arahanto, ", "ja497:23.4": "tesu dinnaṁ mahapphalan”ti. ", "ja497:24.1": "Mātaṅgajātakaṁ paṭhamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja497:0.1": "", "ja497:0.2": "", "ja497:0.3": "", "ja497:0.4": "", "ja497:1.1": "dummavāsī → rummavāsī (bj); rummavāsi (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja497:1.2": "", "ja497:1.3": "paṭimuñca → paṭimucca (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja497:1.4": "hosi → hohisi (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja497:2.1": "tavedaṁ → tava idaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1); tavayidaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja497:2.2": "", "ja497:2.3": "", "ja497:2.4": "", "ja497:3.1": "mamedaṁ → mama idaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1); mamayidaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja497:3.2": "mamedaṁ → mamayidaṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed); mama idaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja497:3.3": "", "ja497:3.4": "", "ja497:4.1": "", "ja497:4.2": "phalamāsamānā → … māsasānā (bj); māsiṁsamānā (sya1ed, sya2ed); māsasāna (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja497:4.3": "", "ja497:4.4": "", "ja497:5.1": "", "ja497:5.2": "", "ja497:5.3": "", "ja497:5.4": "", "ja497:6.1": "", "ja497:6.2": "", "ja497:6.3": "aguṇā yesu ca santi → yesu vasanti (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja497:6.4": "", "ja497:7.1": "", "ja497:7.2": "", "ja497:7.3": "", "ja497:7.4": "", "ja497:8.1": "Kvettha gatā → kvattha gatā (sya1ed, sya2ed); kattheva bhaṭṭhā (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja497:8.2": "gaṇḍakucchi → bhaṇḍakucchi (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja497:8.3": "", "ja497:8.4": "khalayātha → galayātha (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja497:9.1": "", "ja497:9.2": "dantehi → dantena (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja497:9.3": "", "ja497:9.4": "", "ja497:10.1": "", "ja497:10.2": "", "ja497:10.3": "pakkāmi → pakkami (mr) ", "ja497:10.4": "", "ja497:11.1": "Āvellitaṁ → aveṭhitaṁ (bj); āveṭhitaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja497:11.2": "Bāhuṁ → bāhaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) | akammaneyyaṁ → akampaneyyaṁ (mr) ", "ja497:11.3": "", "ja497:11.4": "", "ja497:12.1": "", "ja497:12.2": "", "ja497:12.3": "", "ja497:12.4": "", "ja497:13.1": "", "ja497:13.2": "", "ja497:13.3": "", "ja497:13.4": "", "ja497:14.1": "", "ja497:14.2": "", "ja497:14.3": "", "ja497:14.4": "", "ja497:15.1": "", "ja497:15.2": "", "ja497:15.3": "", "ja497:15.4": "", "ja497:16.1": "", "ja497:16.2": "", "ja497:16.3": "", "ja497:16.4": "", "ja497:17.1": "", "ja497:17.2": "kuddho → kuddha (mr) ", "ja497:17.3": "Tumheva → tuyheva (mr) ", "ja497:17.4": "", "ja497:18.1": "", "ja497:18.2": "mamatthi → mama natthi (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja497:18.3": "", "ja497:18.4": "", "ja497:19.1"